  {
   "n": 4,
   "type": "MCQ",
   "section": "Technical",
   "tags": "single | Marks +1 / -0.33",
   "html": "<p>For the figure shown below, the values of V<sub>0</sub> and I<sub>D</sub> are respectively:&nbsp;(cut-in voltage of diode = 0.7 V)</p>\n<p><img style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; max-width: 400px;\" src=\"media/3c/3c0e34e0ca1ba4a74ff2.png\"></p>",
   "options": [
    {
     "key": "A",
