   "answerText": "A",
   "marks": {
    "pos": 1,
    "neg": 0.33
   },
   "solution": "<p>Since the direction of the resultant current is the same as that of arrows of both diodes so, both&nbsp;the diodes will be forward biased. Replacing the diodes by their voltages and series resistance&nbsp;models, we get as</p>\n<p><img style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; max-width: 400px;\" src=\"media/5e/5e99055e482c926c93a4.png\"></p>\n<p><img style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; max-width: 400px;\" src=\"media/c0/c06f6e96cc5daca877b3.png\"></p>"
