  {
   "n": 9,
   "type": "MCQ",
   "section": "Technical",
   "tags": "single | Marks +2 / -0.66",
   "html": "<p>In the transformer coupled amplifier stage shown V<sub>BE</sub> = 0.7 V, &beta; = 50, and the quiescent voltage&nbsp;is V<sub>CB</sub> = 4 V. Then value of Re is</p>\n<p><img style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; max-width: 400px;\" src=\"media/21/212cd2a85daa5c3c2cf2.png\"></p>",
   "options": [
    {
     "key": "A",
     "html": "<p>2.57 k&Omega;</p>"
    },
    {
     "key": "B",
     "html": "<p>10 k&Omega;</p>"
    },
    {
     "key": "C",
     "html": "<p>5 k&Omega;</p>"
    },
    {
     "key": "D",
     "html": "<p>2.04 &Omega;</p>"
