   "answer": [
    "A"
   ],
   "natRange": null,
   "answerText": "A",
   "marks": {
    "pos": 2,
    "neg": 0.66
   },
   "solution": "<p>First applying KVL in B-E loop, the voltage drop across R<sub>e</sub> will be 6 &ndash; 0.7 = 5.3 V.<br>Now, applying KVL in C-E loop<br>12 + 6 = 4.3I<sub>C</sub> + 4 + 5.3<br>&there4; I<sub>C</sub> = 2.02 mA</p>\n<p><img style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; max-width: 400px;\" src=\"media/6c/6c3b1088bbc813de8d69.png\"></p>"
  },
